# Build context for both backend/Dockerfile and frontend/Dockerfile (root
# context, so `shared` is reachable — B12.1). Keep this in sync with
# .gitignore's reasoning: anything generated, anything secret, never sent to
# the Docker daemon.

**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/test-results
backend/src/generated
storage
infra/backups
pgdata
*.log
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
tmp
*.env
*.env.*
!.env.example
